<title>SPAIN: WATER POLO-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>WATER POLO-EUROPEAN CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SEVILLE, Spain 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Water polo results on the</p>
<p>opening day of the European swimming championships on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Women:</p>
<p>Germany beat Yugoslavia 8-5 (2-3 2-0 1-1 3-1)</p>
<p>Russia beat Portugal 16-5 (2-0 5-2 6-0 3-3)</p>
<p>Hungary beat France 13-2 (4-0 4-1 2-1 3-0)</p>
<p>Men:</p>
<p>Russia beat Bulgaria 13-4 (1-1 5-1 4-0 3-2)</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>Netherlands beat Britain 21-3 (5-0 6-0 7-0 3-3)</p>
<p>Italy beat Spain 6-5 (1-1 0-1 3-2 2-1)</p>
<p>Greece beat Czech Republic 12-2 (3-0 2-0 4-0 3-2)</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>Slovakia beat Netherlands 6-4 (2-0 1-1 1-0 2-3)</p>
<p>Yugoslavia beat Germany 10-5 (1-0 5-1 2-2 2-2)</p>
<p>Italy beat Greece 7-2 (2-1 3-1 1-0 1-0)</p>
<p>Hungary beat Ukraine 13-3 (3-0 4-0 4-1 2-2)</p>
</text>
